/'
    Project: SQLite FreeBASIC port

    File: sqlite3_geopoly_types.bi

    Purpose:

        Preserve source-derived record layouts used by the GeoPoly port.

    Responsibilities:

        - Define polygon parsing, bounding-box, event, segment, and overlap records.
        - Retain the C ABI context needed by translated GeoPoly procedures.

    This file intentionally does NOT contain:

        - GeoPoly algorithms or SQL registration.
        - The canonical R-tree implementation record declarations.
'/
/'
